Package: libraye-archive0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Raye archive engine (library)
 Opens, tests and extracts ZIP, 7z, RAR, tar and many more archives, and
 creates 7z, ZIP and tar archives. Detection is by content, extraction
 never writes outside the destination folder.

Package: libraye-archive-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libraye-archive0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Raye archive engine (development files)
 Headers and pkg-config file of the Raye archive engine.

Package: raye-archive
Architecture: any
Depends: libraye-archive0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Raye archive engine (command line tool)
 raye-archive lists, extracts, tests, creates and updates archives from a
 terminal: 7z, ZIP, RAR (read only), tar and its compressed forms, ISO,
 CAB and more.
